This project is a Quarto website. Complete the check-in and interactive plot on the **Tasks 1 and 2** page, build the dashboard on the **Task 3** page, and explore the optional extension page.

For the official assignment directions, see [Exercise 11 instructions](https://andrewheiss.quarto.pub/datavizsp26_11-exercise-recreate/instructions.html).

## Preview the website

In RStudio, use **Build → Render Website** to render the full website. You can also run `quarto preview` in the Terminal.

## Publish the website

1. Create a free account at [Quarto Pub](https://quartopub.com/) and sign in.
2. In the RStudio Terminal, run `quarto publish`.
3. Choose **Quarto Pub** and follow the prompts.
4. Copy the published website URL shown in the Terminal.
5. Paste that URL into the Exercise 11 submission form in iCollege.

**Do not submit a PDF or Word document.** The assignment requires the URL of the published website because the interactive graphics require HTML.
